text:
You cannot write a type which conditionally implements Drop: <a href="https:&#x2F;&#x2F;play.rust-lang.org&#x2F;?version=stable&amp;mode=debug&amp;edition=2024&amp;gist=b9c43bd56ad9a0b7ea2555d59bc246ce" rel="nofollow">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;play.rust-lang.org&#x2F;?version=stable&amp;mode=debug&amp;editio...</a><p><pre><code>    struct Q&lt;T&gt;(Option&lt;T&gt;);

    impl&lt;T: &#x27;static&gt; Drop for Q&lt;T&gt; {
        fn drop(&amp;mut self) {}
    }


    error[E0367]: `Drop` impl requires `T: &#x27;static` but the struct it is implemented for does not
     --&gt; src&#x2F;main.rs:3:9
      |
    3 | impl&lt;T: &#x27;static&gt; Drop for Q&lt;T&gt; {
      |         ^^^^^^^
      |
    note: the implementor must specify the same requirement
     --&gt; src&#x2F;main.rs:1:1
      |
    1 | struct Q&lt;T&gt;(Option&lt;T&gt;);
      | ^^^^^^^^^^^</code></pre>

Since there were a couple upvotes, here&#x27;s one I saved and Google-translated:<p><pre><code>  &lt;story-record&gt; 

  ## Phase O. This round is a key advancement in the long-term, solidified daily storyline: the two enter Zhou Zhiyi&#x27;s apartment for the first time under the guise of &quot;non-purposeful&quot; activities, and the soup-making incident becomes a new variable in their relationship. The task is to let this soup ferment naturally, without ending it or revealing anything. 

  ## Phase [Reflections on Life] 

  1. Vibrant: Wu San and Wu Si appear as living beings with distinct personalities; Wu San is a drama queen, and Wu Si is slow to warm up; Zhou Zhiyi&#x27;s apartment retains traces of his real life (a rhinoceros beetle insulated box, vinyl records, Pokémon, and a doghouse). 

  2. Cognitive Barrier: Shen Liran&#x27;s &quot;disbelief that he can make soup&quot; and &quot;wanting to kidnap a dog&quot; are information revealed through her words and actions, which Zhou Zhiyi can perceive; however, he
</code></pre>
<i>... [some more gibberish] ...</i><p><pre><code>  Then Wu San saw Shen Liran. 

  This dog&#x27;s opportunism was on full display. Abandoning her father, she turned her short legs and charged towards the backless dress, her front paws gripping the hem, head tilted back, a precisely calculated whimper escaping her throat. Zhou Zhiyi stood in the entryway changing his shoes, coldly observing the performance, thinking, &quot;She&#x27;s been fooled, fooled. I just fed her a treat this morning; she&#x27;s a master of disguise.&quot; 

  Sure enough. He counted to two, and Shen Liran had already squatted down, oblivious to the hem of her coat dragging on the floor. She ran her hands into her long, brown fur coat, her voice sweet enough to make candied fruit: &quot;Oh my, you&#x27;re so soft to touch! Did you miss me? Even your dad isn&#x27;t as good at being affectionate.&quot;

  &quot;Three seconds.&quot; Zhou Zhiyi hung their leashes back on the wall. &quot;I said you wouldn&#x27;t last three seconds, and you didn&#x27;t even last three seconds. You squatted down before she pounced on you; that&#x27;s a false start.&quot;
</code></pre>
Interestingly, in the markdown, which was Chinese mostly, &quot;Phase&quot; and &lt;story-record&gt; were in English.
